Fall Curriculum Unit Plan

Web Development, Artificial Intelligence, Radical Social Entrepreneurship, and Leadership

Overview

This Fall Quarter, our Geniuses will continue developing their technical and entrepreneurial skills through web development, Artificial Intelligence, Radical Social Entrepreneurship, and Leadership. Geniuses will focus on HTML/CSS, JavaScript, AI assisted product development, and Flask while building a responsive website connected to their Radical Social Entrepreneurship business.

Artificial Intelligence will be taught as a practical tool that supports the development process. Geniuses will learn how to prompt effectively, use AI for product research and planning, review and debug code, test ideas, improve user experience, and strengthen the overall quality of their product. The expectation is that AI supports the work rather than completing the work for them. Geniuses should understand the code, decisions, and final product they create.

Geniuses will also continue developing their Radical Social Entrepreneurship businesses by learning how to build financially sustainable ideas, create marketing strategies, develop strong teams, and understand legal structures. Leadership lessons will continue to focus on personal development, financial literacy, education, global community, the Black diaspora, and manhood development.

