Artificial Intelligence Expectations

The AI unit is designed to support the technical and product development work already happening throughout the quarter. Geniuses should use AI as a tool for thinking, building, reviewing, and improving their work.

Geniuses should be able to explain any AI generated code used in their project.

AI generated code should be tested before being added to the final product.

Important information produced by AI should be reviewed and verified.

Private or sensitive information should not be entered into AI tools.

AI recommendations should be treated as suggestions. The Genius or team is responsible for the final decision.

Each team will keep an AI Development Log with at least five meaningful examples showing how AI supported the project.

