Final Project Connection

By the end of the quarter, each Genius or team should have a functional Flask based web application connected to a Radical Social Entrepreneurship business. The final product should demonstrate technical development, a clear target user, a meaningful problem or need, a realistic business direction, and thoughtful use of AI throughout the development process.
